<div class="stat"><div class="s-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate"></i></div><div><b>Certified</b><span>Notes + Videos + Certificate</span></div></div>
<div class="stat"><div class="s-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i></div><div><b>A-Grades</b><span>WAEC, JAMB, IGCSE, GCSE, SAT</span></div></div>
