<section class="section section-dark" id="classrooms">
<div class="eyebrow eyebrow-center"><span style="width:30px;height:2px;background:#ffcc33;display:inline-block"></span> GET STARTED IN 3 STEPS <span style="width:30px;height:2px;background:#ffcc33;display:inline-block"></span></div>
<h2 class="title">Join Your Country Classroom <span class="gold">in Seconds</span></h2>
<p class="subtitle">Professional international classrooms with same Physics, Chemistry, Biology & Mathematics curriculum tailored for your region</p>
<div class="two-grid">
